            "review_text": "Deidre B\nNowra, Australia75 contributions\n0\nNice steak but very expensive\nJun 2026 • Couples\nWas surprised to find out when ordering a 250gram rib eye steak @ 690k VND they only allow for chips or mashed potato or a salad. The portions served with the chips and salad were small and I would’ve thought for the price that they should’ve included salad with chips or mashed potato and veggies like most pubs or restaurants provide. \nWe were served a free starter of garlic bread which I couldn’t eat as I’m gluten intolerant and we asked about an alternative and none was provided. \nCompared to other venues we have been to the meal was expensive but the steak was lovely. \nThe waiters were generally good but one of the waiters couldn’t poor the beer properly and spilt the beer onto the table.\nRead more\nWritten June 16, 2026",
