            "review_text": "Ruben J\n1 contribution\n0\nFantastic Steakhouse!\nJun 2026 • Friends\nThe food was delicious and the service was exquisite! We were served at our beck and call. The service was very nice and were constantly waiting for us.\nThe host Elh, Filipino employee was very enthusiastic, polite and did his job fantastic. We had a nice chat with him and he said that he was also the English teacher of the rest of the staff. Great guy! If you're in the area go eat here, you get your money's worth! Very good food, drinks and great service!\n\nThe food was delicious and the service was excellent! We were waiting on hand and foot. The staff were very friendly and constantly at our service.\n\nThe host, Elh, a Filipino employee, was very enthusiastic, polite, and did his job fantastically. We had a nice chat with him and he told us that he was also the English teacher for the rest of the staff. Great guy! If you are in the area, go eat here; you get your money's worth! Very good food, drinks, and great service!\nRead more\nTranslated from Dutch\nShow original\nWritten June 4, 2026",
